Colour modes per board row (the Z3660: no 32-bit) and RTGIOC_GETCAPS

Each board row lists the colour modes its board can show; SETMODE and
SETMODEHZ refuse the others with EINVAL.  The Z3660's HDMI is RGB565 on a
16-pin bus: a 32-bit mode showed nothing (2026-11-07).  RTGIOC_GETCAPS
(io/rtgcaps.h) reports the depths and the board's capabilities.
amix-gate 4b2586f (io/zz9000), the same change.

